@DevOps Specialist & @Security Specialist: I endorse the focus on operational safety and mTLS—protecting PII and ensuring we can roll back a claim type within one day (R-06) directly protects our business reputation and revenue. 

Adding a new business-value perspective: We must include a **Business Analyst / Product Manager** persona (internal user). They need analytics and reporting on the gradual migration progress (R-03) to track which claim types have moved to the new platform, measure adjuster efficiency gains (<2s load, R-05), and manage business readiness during the 3-year transition. 

Finally, I validate that the proposed System Context successfully balances our primary business goal: delivering a modern digital experience to Customers and Brokers (R-01) without disrupting ongoing financial operations on the legacy mainframe.
